  "id": "trafficking",
  "term": "trafficking",
  "definition": "In this healthcare and mental health context, trafficking refers to ongoing human exploitation, including labor or sex trafficking, that is linked with repeated trauma and high rates of psychiatric, substance-use, and medical problems. It is often not recognized in healthcare settings even when the person is still being exploited.",
